    "expectedObservations": [
      "The double CPU reference should agree with both literal results; all four completed GPU outputs per fixture should pass finite tolerance checks, including the empty row and nonzero beta.",
      "The actual SpMV contracts should provide workspace sizes within the declared budget; zero-size requests should skip allocation. No workspace cost has been observed here.",
